     </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style="width: 20%;"><br></td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;; text-align: center;">Laki-laki</td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;; text-align: center;">Perempuan</td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;"><br></td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;"><br></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style="width: 20%;">(010) PANGKALAN<br></td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;; text-align: right;">3.428</td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;; text-align: right;">2.748</td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;; text-align: right;">725/Km<sup>2</sup></td>\n            <td style="width: 20%;; text-align: right;">112 km<sup>2</sup></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br>\n\n</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Dorothy lived in the midst of the great Kansas prairies, with Uncle Henry, who was a farmer, and Aunt Em, who was the farmerâ€™s wife. Their house was small, for the lumber to build it had to be carried by wagon many miles. There were four walls, a floor and a roof, which made one room; and this room contained a rusty looking cookstove, a cupboard for the dishes, a table, three or four chairs, and the beds. Uncle Henry and Aunt Em had a big bed in one corner, and Dorothy a little bed in another corner. There was no garret at all, and no cellarâ€”except a small hole dug in the ground, called a cyclone cellar, where the family could go in case one of those great whirlwinds arose, mighty enough to crush any building in its path. It was reached by a trap door in the middle of the floor, from which a ladder led down into the small, dark hole.</p><br><br>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-12-28 04:31:03'),
	(2010, NULL, '2024', '585', NULL, '2024-12-13', '13 Desember 2024', 'B-585/32150/KA.220/2024', 'BPS Karawang', 'Kepala BPS Propinsi Jawa Barat', 'Permohonan Karis Baru a.n. Suwirno', '<p style="text-align: justify;">Sehubungan dengan laporan kehilangan Karis atas nama&nbsp;salah satu pegawai BPS Kabupaten Karawang yaitu <strong>Suwirno</strong>, pemohon telah melengkapi dokumen Surat Kehilangan dari Kepolisian, adapun informasi Karis lama yaitu:</p>\n\n<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 94.5217%; height: 119px;">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style="width:18%;">Nomor Karis</td>\n            <td style="width: 2%;">: </td>\n\n            <td style="width: 80%;">3215649898766<br></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Nama</td>\n            <td>: </td>\n            <td>Luna Maya<br></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Alamat</td>\n            <td>: </td>\n            <td>Kampung Jebug RT 005/014 Desa Waluya, Kecamatan Kutawaluya, Kabupaten Karawang<br></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Dengan ini kami mohon untuk dapat diterbitkan Karis baru atas nama tersebut diatas.</p>\n\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Demikian surat permohonan ini dibuat dan menjadu maklum dan diucapkan terimakasih.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-12-28 04:44:23'),
	(2011, '01', '2025', '0062', NULL, '2025-01-24', '24 Januari 2025', 'B-0062/32150/KA.220/2025', 'Kepala Badan Pusat Statistik Kabupaten Karawang', 'Kepala Dinas Komunikasi dan Informatika Kabupaten Karawang', 'Jawaban Koordinasi dan Konsultasi', '<p class="MsoBodyText" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px 2px 0px 80px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 44px; line-height: 150%;"><span lang="EN-US">Menjawab\n        surat no </span><span lang="id">500.14/150/Stat</span><span lang="EN-US"> tanggal 17 Januari 2025 tentang Permohonan\n        Koordinasi dan Konsultasi Pemeriksaan Daftar Data, Metadata dan Review\n        EPSS, maka kami akan kami terima pada&nbsp;</span><span lang="id"><span>&nbsp;</span>:</span></p>\n\n<p class="MsoBodyText" style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif;"><span lang="id">&nbsp;</span><br></p>\n\n<p class="MsoBodyText" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px 285px 0px 127px; line-height: 142%;"><span lang="id">Hari/Tanggal&nbsp; &nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US">Kamis</span><span lang="id">, </span><span lang="EN-US">3</span><span lang="id">0 Januari 2025 </span></p><p class="MsoBodyText" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px 285px 0px 127px; line-height: 142%;"><span lang="id"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px;">Waktu</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="id">Pukul&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0px;">08</span><span lang="id">.00 WIB s.d selesai</span></p>\n\n<p class="MsoBodyText" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 127px;"><span lang="id" style="letter-spacing: 0px;">Tempat</span><span lang="id"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>:&nbsp; Ruang&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0px;">rapat lantai 1 </span><span lang="id">BPSKabupaten<span style="letter-spacing: 0px;"> Karawang</span></span></p>\n\n<p class="MsoBodyText" style="margin: 16px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif;"><span lang="id">&nbsp;</span><br></p>\n\n<p class="MsoBodyText" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Arial MT&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px 8px 0px 80px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 44px; line-height: 150%;"><span lang="id">Demikian disampaikan</span><span lang="EN-US">.</span><span lang="id">Atas </span><span lang="EN-US">perhatian</span><span lang="id"> dan kerjasamanya diucapkan terima kasih.</span></p>', NULL, NULL, 6, '2025-01-24 03:06:08', '2025-01-24 03:11:57');
